{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34389","headline":"奉和袭美闻开元寺开笋园寄章上人 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美闻开元寺开笋园寄章上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春龙争地养檀栾，况是双林雨後看。\n迸出似毫当垤㙞，孤生如恨倚栏干。\n凌虚势欲齐金刹，折赠光宜照玉盘。\n更得锦苞零落後，粉环高下局烟寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}